- Trimmer: each built-in trimmer reduces a sample verbose input while preserving key facts (assert specific substrings survive); custom registered trimmer is invoked when `enabled_tools` includes its name.
- Client: `create()` returns the same response shape as a plain OpenAI call (mock the underlying API); metrics are recorded with correct `tokens_before`/`tokens_after`; an exception inside dedup/trim/compress doesn’t propagate to the caller.

